OL,3,APaul Heaton scores first number one
OL,4,Aalbum as Dolly Parton's 9 to 5 finally
OL,5,Areaches top 40
OL,6,
OL,7,FDolly Parton, who died earlier this
OL,8,Fweek, aged 80, has three singles in the
OL,9,Ftop 40, including 9 to 5, which landed
OL,10,Fat number 12 in this week's UK chart,
OL,11,Fhaving previously peaked at 47 in 1981.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
